  "interpretation": "<p>A pathogenic mutation was identified in the RET gene, associated with Multiple Endocrine Neoplasia Type 2A (MEN2A).<br>This suggests hereditary predisposition to medullary thyroid carcinoma, pheochromocytoma, and hyperparathyroidism.<br>Genetic counseling and family screening are strongly recommended.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
